        <name>MR_IFillContours2DPlanCache</name>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>keeps the buffers of fillContours2DPlan alive between calls (the sweep-line triangulation&apos;s own cache among them), so a caller preparing plans for many holes one by one avoids re-allocating them on every call; one cache must not be used by several threads at once Generated from class <computeroutput>MR::IFillContours2DPlanCache</computeroutput>. </para>
